00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.070
Do that with Robert Downey Jr.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:44.420
Just send Downey Jr. back in time to join
King Arthur.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.420
Look.

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:46.720
Last year was a really hard year.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.570
I think we all need this.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:49.570
Yeah.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:53.720
I am absolutely on board with Disney's End
Game and this being like spending a billion

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:56.650
dollars on this movie for nobody.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.310
Just no one is going to enjoy this.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.310
Yeah.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.310
I want this to be such a big budget.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.889
Game of Thrones level budget.

00:05:01.889 --> 00:05:04.430
Like they build a castle, they don't even
