00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.660
There's castles everywhere in Europe.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.710
They build one anyway.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:07.710
Yeah.

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.240
I have big dreams for this.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:13.130
They go to like local Shakespeare in the Park
performances and they find the worst actors

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:16.810
that they can get, and they give them these
big, meaty, Arthurian characters to play.

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:17.810
No, better.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:21.360
They go to a renaissance fair in the middle
