And they pick that guy, and they bring him
in and they're like, "You will play King Arthur."

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.230
Outstanding.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.650
Outstanding.

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:40.370
He pulls the foam sword from the foam rock,
