00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.110
I like it.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.110
Yeah.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:50.050
So that is my pick for the weirdest what-if
story, but weirdly the more I thought about

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:54.020
it and the more I talk about it, the more
