00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.370
So you're into it?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:06:03.229
I'm into it because it's so stupid, and it
has the potential to be so just campy and

00:06:03.229 --> 00:06:04.229
dumb.

00:06:04.229 --> 00:06:05.870
This is what I live for.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:07.750
This is why I'm here.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:08.830
I like it.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:15.420
My pick was issue number six, which is what
if the Fantastic Four had gotten different

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:16.420
powers.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:21.160
So in the original, in the normal, the accepted
