00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:34.160
Johnny Storm, the human torch, he becomes
flamy and on fire.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.940
And then The Thing, Ben Grimm, he becomes
a big rocky guy.

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:39.940
Thing?

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:40.940
Yeah.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:41.940
A big rocky thing.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:42.940
Yes.

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:43.940
