Yeah, as one does.

00:11:12.319 --> 00:11:13.319
They're having an argument.

00:11:13.319 --> 00:11:18.050
And then all of a sudden this guy appears
out of nowhere and his name is, I think, the

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:21.129
Scarlet Centurion, and they've never met him
before.

00:11:21.129 --> 00:11:26.470
And he's like, "Listen guys, in the future,
