00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.990
And they're like, "No, they don't."

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:31.010
And he's like, "Yes, they do."

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.010
"Nah."

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:34.149
And they're like, "All right."

00:11:34.149 --> 00:11:41.860
So they've been properly convinced that there
should be no more superheroes by this four

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:49.730
panel discussion and so the Avengers proceed
to commit genocide.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:50.949
They go out into the world.

00:11:50.949 --> 00:11:55.519
It's alarmingly abrupt.

