comes in and almost beats the first team of

00:13:40.299 --> 00:13:41.529
Avengers.

00:13:41.529 --> 00:13:46.109
That's relatively boilerplate for comic books,
but what makes it fascinating is that Hawkeye

00:13:46.109 --> 00:13:51.100
meets Thor, and they're very vague as to how
that happened.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:55.360
There's just a shot with a twang onomatopoeia,
and then Thor's down.

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.360
Anyway.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.449
Hawkeye beats Thor.

00:13:57.449 --> 00:14:00.920
Really, the whole premise of that what-if
